# The form of /usuarios, and every field declares its type.
#
# Both ends take it from the same declaration, so the field names add nothing on the wire: the
# upload is positional, and in binary. With a long enough note it passes the threshold of
# src/http.fudapi and goes gzipped as well. What the server refuses with 400, 409 or 422 the
# form keeps, painted in its summary, and never goes to error-pages.
form personForm
  catches 400 409 422

  name  str = ""
    required             "Escribe el nombre."
  email  str = ""
    required             "Escribe el email."
    pattern email-loose  "Ese email no parece válido."
    email-taken          "Ese email ya lo usa otra persona."
  age  u8
    required             "Escribe la edad."
    min 18               "Tiene que tener al menos {n} años."
    max 120              "Como mucho {n} años."
  active  bool = true
  notes  str = ""
